  Reading it. This is the FLOOR the thesis-formulation test would
  inherit. The ordering effect to be resolved is 1-3%, so a floor near
  1e-2 is not enough -- it needs to be nearer 1e-3 for the comparison
  to mean anything. Reported, not gated: this is a capability
  measurement, and its job is to say whether the route is worth taking.
